:: Intro {"position":"300,300","size":"100,100"}
// Chapter Title
[chapter Chapter One]


<h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.5em;">Chapter One</h2>

The sun has almost set by the time you arrive in the crumbling city of Dravenhold. 
Shadows stretch long and sharp over the cracked cobblestones, and the air is heavy with decay. 
You are here for one purpose: to kill the monster.

The empty streets guide you deeper into the ruined city, where abandoned homes stand with their doors left open and market stalls have long since collapsed beneath years of neglect.

Somewhere beyond the rooftops, the silhouette of the great church rises above everything else, watching over the dead city like a monument to its downfall.


[move Streets]


