:: StoryAuthor {"position":"100,100","size":"100,100"}
Story by Author


:: Streets {"position":"300,500","size":"100,100"}
As you make your way through the narrow streets, you notice deep gouges carved into the stone walls and long trails of dried blood leading toward the city center.

Whatever happened here was not the work of frightened people fleeing in panic.

Something hunted them.


[bookmark]


You pause beside the remains of an overturned wagon where scattered supplies lie half-buried beneath dust and broken timber. Nothing of value remains, but the brief stop reminds you to check your own gear before facing the creature that brought Dravenhold to ruin.

You take one final moment to inspect your equipment before entering the church.


- Check Equipment : Equipment
- Continue : Churchyard


:: Turn {"position":"1200,750","size":"100,100"}
// New Turn

[stamina + 3]
[if stamina > stamina.max]
	[stamina = stamina.max]
[end]


[move Battle]


:: Victory {"position":"1000,600","size":"100,100"}
Breathing heavily, you steady your hand for the final blow.

With a precise strike, you pierce its chest. The monster lets out a piercing howl, crumbling to the ground as the light in its eyes dims.

The abomination is no more. You slay the beast!

[close]


